ction class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"kicker\\\">Connect • Plan a Session</span>\\n        <h1>Elevate your rhythm: bespoke sound experiences with {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">We design sensory-rich sound baths — from intimate private sessions to curated VIP days — blending vibration, guided breathwork, and intentional pause. Use this page to tell us about your needs or to book a consultation for a VIP Day.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:16px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"btn\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"muted\\\" href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">Call: {{PHONE}}</a>\\n          <a class=\\\"muted\\\" href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:18px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <ul class=\\\"split\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n            <li>Premium · Sensory</li>\\n            <li>Small groups</li>\\n            <li>Corporate</li>\\n            <li>Ceremonial space</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"card\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:800;color:#fff\\\">Quick Connect</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Send a message and we&apos;ll reply within 48 hours</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)\\\">VIP Day</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)\\\">Tailored, immersive private day</div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <form id=\\\"contactForm\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your name\\\" required>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"you@domain.com\\\" required>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" placeholder=\\\"(optional)\\\">\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"session\\\">Session type</label>\\n          <select id=\\\"session\\\" name=\\\"session\\\">\\n            <option>Group — Public Event</option>\\n            <option>Private 1:1 Session</option>\\n            <option>Couples</option>\\n            <option>Corporate/Team</option>\\n            <option>VIP Day — Full immersion</option>\\n          </select>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"date\\\">Preferred date</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"date\\\" type=\\\"date\\\" name=\\\"date\\\">\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"message\\\">Tell us briefly (goals, guest count, accessibility)</label>\\n          <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" rows=\\\"4\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"A brief note...\\\" ></textarea>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n            <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">Send inquiry</button>\\n            <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\">Or email us</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </form>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6)\\\">\\n          <strong>Location:</strong> {{VENUE_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}<br>\\n          <strong>Phone:</strong> <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">{{PHONE}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n\\n      <!-- Diagnostic -->\\n      <section class=\\\"card diagnostic\\\" style=\\\"grid-column:1/3;margin-top:18px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:900;color:#fff\\\">Health & Contraindications</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">A short checklist to ensure safety and comfort</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">This helps us adapt the soundscape for you</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"diag-grid\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <label><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" id=\\\"preg\\\"/> Pregnant or trying to conceive</label>\\n          <label><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" id=\\\"pacemaker\\\"/> Have a pacemaker or implanted device</label>\\n          <label><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" id=\\\"epilepsy\\\"/> Epilepsy / seizure disorder</label>\\n          <label><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" id=\\\"recent\\\"/> Recent surgery or open wounds</label>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7)\\\">\\n          Important: If any checked box applies to you, notify us before booking. Certain instruments (e.g., large gongs) and intense low-frequency tones may be contraindicated. We can adapt the session with gentle bowls and tuning forks instead.\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- Plan -->\\n      <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"grid-column:1/3;margin-top:10px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:900;color:#fff\\\">Booking Plan — How a VIP Day unfolds</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">A practical roadmap for private and corporate days</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Tailored timeline</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <ol class=\\\"plan-list\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <li>\\n            <strong>1. Inquiry & diagnostic</strong> — You submit the form. We review accessibility and goals, then schedule a 30-minute consultation call.\\n          </li>\\n          <li>\\n            <strong>2. Design call</strong> — Choose instruments, room layout, and sensory elements (lighting, aromatics). We prepare a bespoke running order.\\n          </li>\\n          <li>\\n            <strong>3. Reserve & logistics</strong> — Contract and deposit secure the date. We coordinate travel, AV needs, and venue setup.\\n          </li>\\n          <li>\\n            <strong>4. VIP Day</strong> — Arrival & grounding (15 min), immersive sound session(s) (60–90 min depending), gentle integration with tea and journaling, optional short coaching module.\\n          </li>\\n          <li>\\n            <strong>5. Follow-up</strong> — Aftercare suggestions and optional add-on sessions for sustained results.\\n          </li>\\n        </ol>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- Micro habits -->\\n      <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"grid-column:1/3;margin-top:10px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:900;color:#fff\\\">Micro Habits — Prepare & Recover</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Small practices that heighten benefit</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Practical • evidence-informed</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <ul class=\\\"habits-list\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <li><strong>Hydrate well</strong> — Drink water the day of and avoid heavy meals right before.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Wear soft layers</strong> — Comfortable clothing, socks, and a blanket for market-level temperature sensitivity.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Bring a pillow</strong> or eye-cover if you prefer. We provide mats but feel free to bring your favorites.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Journal</strong> — Bring a small notebook for reflections post-session.</li>\\n          <li><strong>Post-session</strong> — Light movement and water help integrate vibrational shifts.</li>\\n        </ul>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7)\\\"><strong>What to bring:</strong> mat or blanket (if you have one), small pillow, water bottle, eye mask, and an open curiosity. For VIP Days we recommend a change of clothes and layers for comfort.</div>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <!-- Pricing -->\\n      <section class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"grid-column:1/3;margin-top:10px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:900;color:#fff\\\">Investment</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Transparent options for group and private offerings</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Custom proposals available</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"pricing-grid\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:800;color:#fff;font-size:18px\\\">Public Sound Bath</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Community events • 60–75 mins</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:900;color:var(--accent);font-size:20px;margin-top:8px\\\">$25–45 / person</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;margin-top:8px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65)\\\">Includes crystal bowls, chimes and light guidance.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:800;color:#fff;font-size:18px\\\">Private Session (1:1)</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">60 minutes personalized</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:900;color:var(--accent);font-size:20px;margin-top:8px\\\">$175</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;margin-top:8px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65)\\\">Tuning forks, crystal bowls, and guided integration included.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:800;color:#fff;font-size:18px\\\">VIP Day</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Full-day bespoke 